#: .\backend\calculation\comparative\views.py:44
msgid ""
"It represents the comparisons between the amounts requested by the creditor, "
"the notices of the \n"
"            AJ and the Company under Recovering, compared with the "
"calculation made by DTT. The result is the \n"
"            difference in amounts and percentage of the rates, the sum of "
"the rates, the interest applied and the\n"
"            advocative hours\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"Representa as comparações entre os valores solicitados pelo credor, os "
"editais da \n"
"            AJ e a Recuperanda, em comparação com o cálculo feito pela DTT. "
"O resultado é a \n"
"            diferença nos valores e percentual das taxas, a soma das taxas, "
"os juros aplicados e as\n"
"            honorários advocatícios"

